      "id": "six-y-forms-and-solution-counts",
      "source_numbers": [
        "452"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "把每组的两条方程都化为用$x$表示$y$，再判断解的个数。哪份完整记录正确？\na) $y-6x=0$，$4x-y=-2$；\nb) $5x+8y=24$，$x+12y=36$；\nc) $1.5x-4y=1$，$8y=3x-2$；\nd) $0.2x+0.3y=0$，$x+1.5y=4$；\ne) $2x=11-3y$，$3y=11-2x$；\nf) $4x-3y=7$，$5x+2y=26$。\n每行的两个变形式与原方程顺序一致。",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "|组|两个变形式|解的个数|\n|---|---|---|\n|a|$y=6x$；$y=6x+2$|无解|\n|b|$y=3-\\frac58x$；$y=3-\\frac58x$|无限多|\n|c|$y=\\frac38x-\\frac14$；$y=\\frac38x+\\frac14$|无解|\n|d|$y=-\\frac23x$；$y=-\\frac23x$|无限多|\n|e|$y=\\frac{11}3-\\frac23x$；$y=\\frac{11}3+\\frac23x$|唯一|\n|f|$y=\\frac43x-\\frac73$；$y=\\frac43x+13$|无解|",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "|组|两个变形式|解的个数|\n|---|---|---|\n|a|$y=6x$；$y=4x+2$|唯一|\n|b|$y=3-\\frac58x$；$y=3-\\frac1{12}x$|唯一|\n|c|$y=\\frac38x-\\frac14$；$y=\\frac38x-\\frac14$|无限多|\n|d|$y=-\\frac23x$；$y=\\frac83-\\frac23x$|无解|\n|e|$y=\\frac{11}3-\\frac23x$；$y=\\frac{11}3-\\frac23x$|无限多|\n|f|$y=\\frac43x-\\frac73$；$y=13-\\frac52x$|唯一|",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "|组|两个变形式|解的个数|\n|---|---|---|\n|a|$y=-6x$；$y=4x+2$|唯一|\n|b|$y=-3+\\frac58x$；$y=3-\\frac1{12}x$|唯一|\n|c|$y=-\\frac38x+\\frac14$；$y=\\frac38x-\\frac14$|唯一|\n|d|$y=\\frac23x$；$y=\\frac83-\\frac23x$|唯一|\n|e|$y=-\\frac{11}3+\\frac23x$；$y=\\frac{11}3-\\frac23x$|唯一|\n|f|$y=-\\frac43x+\\frac73$；$y=13-\\frac52x$|唯一|",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
